      "value": "@{5fa30b66b36d4b12af626dc8|full_name}: \nGladly! :3\nAlthough I just tried to post a video, and it seems I can only post images here. I will upload the video I captured to YouTube, and post a link to the YouTube video.\nHere is one of the worlds this bug is occurring in:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_d3f46426-4b62-4765-b733-d1ffaec40099\nI've been in this world with a few friends, a Valve Index user, Quest2 via link cable through Steam user, and a VivePro user. I was the only person using a WMR headset, the HP Reverb G2, and the only one to have this issue.\nHere is the video:\nhttps://youtu.be/42Hg7Ms-0JE",
